# SitePro Platform

When working inside `apps/platform`:

- Read and follow `apps/platform/AGENTS.md`.
- Treat this application as the public SitePro marketing website.
- Keep it independent from dashboard and tenant website/editor architecture.
- Prefer simple implementations over unnecessary abstraction.
- Preserve SEO, accessibility and performance.
- Do not infer business requirements from design mockup placeholder content.
- Consult relevant `/docs` files when product behavior is involved.